<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 160-7 V INDIA AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 160-7 V INDIA AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 160-7 at tea on the first day of the one-off test against India on Thursday.</p>
